{"title":"Virikh Templar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 53 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (2.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>225</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>238</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>225</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>238</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>12</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-templar\" data-map-level=\"53\">Show level 53 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/f2cf6d115aa44596472c.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/7f94933bcea154fb0661.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/8c92c1a7459808b1c464.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/0daa3638c429dd9245f9.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/a5194048a7e028e118ed.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/11bb300274d693cce637.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/f2cf6d115aa44596472c.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 8 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 8 looted corpses, 55 recorded drops, 4,085 total, 27–163 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-arms\" title=\"Titanium Arms - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/bb0d8fcc8405579f74ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-rapier\" title=\"Titanium Rapier - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/90842e1c199f494d84dd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Rapier</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-head\" title=\"Titanium Head - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b0a1dcb7a8a29c4f1ffd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-spear\" title=\"Titanium Spear - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/025903982d7f079cd8a5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-torso\" title=\"Dragonhide Torso - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c0c11b01db6e83ae53a8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 25% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 2/8</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"titanium-mace\" title=\"Titanium Mace (of-corrosion x1) - in 13% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab2218963a9ff8a74162.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">13% · 1/8</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 25% of 8 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 2/8</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Ashen Citadel</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 67</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-242\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 45 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"virikh-templar\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-ashen-templar\"><img src=\"data/img/f2cf6d115aa44596472c.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Ashen Templar</b><span>Lv 53</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/7f94933bcea154fb0661.webp\" alt=\"Virikh Templar\"></div><h3>Virikh Templar</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 53)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Skeleton</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>344</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>33.7</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,650</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>100 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}